  <h3>1. Production-Grade Example: Custom Spliterator, Custom Collector, and Circuit Breaking</h3>
  <p>
    Below is a full enterprise-grade example demonstrating a custom <code>Spliterator</code> that parses fixed-length streaming log records from a byte buffer, processes them in parallel, handles circuit breaking upon encountering toxic corrupt records, and collects results using a custom concurrent accumulator.
  </p>

  <pre><code>package com.ent
